<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman picks 11 UK stocks for 97.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman picks 11 UK stocks for 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at Lehman Brothers on Wednesday named 11 UK stocks they expect to outperform through 1997, as part of a pan-European list of 19 favoured stocks.</p>
<p>In the UK Lehman strategists picked airport operator BAA Plc, British Telecommunications Plc, Enterprise Oil Plc, cable television operator General Cable Plc, food and drink group Grand Metropolitan Plc, hotel and media group Granada Group Plc, banking group HSBC Holdings Plc, automotive group Lucas Varity Plc, insurance group Prudential Corp Plc, mining group RTZ Corp Plc and drug group Zeneca Plc.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
